---
// 2.2 — Work small: iteration loop diagram
---

<div class="loop-wrap">
  <div class="loop-label">THE VALIDATION LOOP</div>
  <div class="loop-diagram">
    <div class="loop-step step-1">
      <div class="step-num">01</div>
      <div class="step-text">Pick one tool<br />or function</div>
    </div>
    <div class="loop-connector">→</div>
    <div class="loop-step step-2">
      <div class="step-num">02</div>
      <div class="step-text">Write the<br />rewrite</div>
    </div>
    <div class="loop-connector">→</div>
    <div class="loop-step step-3">
      <div class="step-num">03</div>
      <div class="step-text">Compare output<br />vs original</div>
    </div>
    <div class="loop-connector loop-connector-back">↙ adjust &amp; repeat</div>
    <div class="loop-step step-4 step-pass">
      <div class="step-num">✓</div>
      <div class="step-text">Outputs<br />match</div>
    </div>
    <div class="loop-connector loop-connector-next">→ next component</div>
  </div>
  <div class="loop-note">
    Never move on until the current step is validated. Compound complexity will bury you.
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .loop-wrap {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .loop-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .loop-diagram {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .loop-step {
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    text-align: center;
    min-width: 80px;
  }

  .step-pass {
    border-color: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.4);
    background: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.06);
  }

  .step-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--rust-500);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .step-pass .step-num {
    color: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.9);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .step-text {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .loop-connector {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .loop-connector-back {
    color: rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.6);
  }

  .loop-connector-next {
    color: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.6);
  }

  .loop-note {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    padding-top: var(--space-sm);
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
